    "body": "This test ensures that multiple priority packets added to a `TCP_Connection` while the socket is busy are correctly queued in the linked list without dropping intermediate packets.\r\n\r\nSpecifically, it protects against regressions where updating the tail pointer incorrectly (e.g., using the head pointer as a base for append) would result in data loss. This was identified as a risk in PR #2387.\n\n<!-- Reviewable:start -->\n- - -\nThis change is [<img src=\"https://reviewable.io/review_button.svg\" height=\"34\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"Reviewable\"/>](https://reviewable.io/reviews/TokTok/c-toxcore/2988)\n<!-- Reviewable:end -->\n",
